# ⚠️ UPLOADED TRADE DOCUMENTS LIVE HERE AND MUST NEVER BE COMMITTED.
# Business cards and resale certificates carry personal data; sole
# proprietors often use an SSN as their tax ID. TRADE_PROGRAM_SPEC:
# "Do NOT store them in a publicly reachable uploads directory."
#
# This directory is also deliberately OUTSIDE public/, so express.static
# does not serve it. The only read path is the authenticated admin route
# tradeController.adminDoc, which streams the file from disk.
#
# Ignore everything, keep the directory itself.
*
!.gitignore
